  message: "ADDENDUM (WI-lihis): two more declared levels belong in this row's per-attribute table beside the precedence order — merge_producers.CORROBORATED_CONFIDENCE (0.95, §13) and finalize.SUPERSEDED_STUB_RANK_FACTOR (0.5, §14). Both are module constants today; both should become preferences in the same [merge] section, non-trust (they execute nothing)."  # c284
